{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghmnvcykyoRFAxSG3o8w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JAseMXmDWxUkNAJ5fHHz33","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261104-020620__x696bb3/work/Skiller7-Killer7-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-020620 && rm -f tmp/*.mjs tmp/*.png && cat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# SKILLER7 — dev folder\n\nAn original on-rails scan-and-shoot game inspired by Killer7, built on my-3D2dge v0.85.2 and its 3D module.\n\n- `node tools/build.mjs` builds `../Skiller7-Killer7-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-020620.html` (and `out/bundle.js`).\n- `node tests/run.mjs` runs every test (Node suites, then browser suites and the AI Hub harness); it prints only\n  failures and one line with the count. `--node`, `--browser`, `--only a,b`, `--metrics`, `--quick`.\n- `node tests/browser/look.mjs` saves screenshots for review into `tests/out/look/`; `node tools/sheet.mjs` tiles them.\n- `python3 tools/patch-engine.py engine/my-3d2dge.js` applies the S7 PATCHes to a pristine engine\n  (`engine/my-3d2dge.orig.js` is the untouched v0.85.2 file).\n\nLayout: `src/` the game's systems (core, input, world and rails, sim, combat, bosses, audio, UI, HUD, dev mode, bot,\nattract, Echo Run and the AI Hub, presenter, scenes, start); `content/` the data (personas, weapons, enemies, items,\nareas, story, songs, shapes, About); `engine/` the handoff copy (patched) and the 3D module; `vendor/` three.js,\nRapier and the AI Hub client and harness; `tests/` the suites and the golden route.\nEOF\nls; du -sh . 2>/dev/null | tail -1","description":"Clean scratch files and add dev README"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":909,"cache_read_input_tokens":848874,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":909},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a19d4130-5ad5-4253-b2f9-ab1e00f8ce04","uuid":"f47648a5-bdc7-4ee6-8a7a-ff8f7881e4ea","timestamp":"2026-11-04T11:01:13.998Z","request_id":"req_011CghmnvBSNGZDqjutT2jdz","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01JAseMXmDWxUkNAJ5fHHz33":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261104-020620__x696bb3/work/Skiller7-Killer7-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-020620 && rm -f tmp/*.mjs tmp/*.png && cat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# SKILLER7 — dev folder\n\nAn original on-rails scan-and-shoot game inspired by Killer7, built on my-3D2dge v0.85.2 and its 3D module.\n\n- `node tools/build.mjs` builds `../Skiller7-Killer7-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-020620.html` (and `out/bundle.js`).\n- `node tests/run.mjs` runs every test (Node suites, then browser suites and the AI Hub harness); it prints only\n  failures and one line with the count. `--node`, `--browser`, `--only a,b`, `--metrics`, `--quick`.\n- `node tests/browser/look.mjs` saves screenshots for review into `tests/out/look/`; `node tools/sheet.mjs` tiles them.\n- `python3 tools/patch-engine.py engine/my-3d2dge.js` applies the S7 PATCHes to a pristine engine\n  (`engine/my-3d2dge.orig.js` is the untouched v0.85.2 file).\n\nLayout: `src/` the game's systems (core, input, world and rails, sim, combat, bosses, audio, UI, HUD, dev mode, bot,\nattract, Echo Run and the AI Hub, presenter, scenes, start); `content/` the data (personas, weapons, enemies, items,\nareas, story, songs, shapes, About); `engine/` the handoff copy (patched) and the 3D module; `vendor/` three.js,\nRapier and the AI Hub client and harness; `tests/` the suites and the golden route.\nEOF\nls; du -sh . 2>/dev/null | tail -1","description":"Clean scratch files and add dev README"}}}
