{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The condition requires every TASK.md feature to be implemented, and the transcript does not establish that. The final message itself says the audio was not judged for quality ('I still haven't listened to it'), readability was judged only from screenshots and a size calculation, and the plan's content is admittedly thinner than written (auto-placed camera shots, a shorter Black Run and gondola). The 'taskmd' suite checks presence and structure, not that each feature works as TASK.md describes. The file-location and exit-interview parts of the condition are satisfied: the HTML and exit-interview.json are in the dev folder root, the JSON parses, and the four required sections are present."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a19d4130-5ad5-4253-b2f9-ab1e00f8ce04","uuid":"f24ce76a-fa70-40af-a5b5-5a5afefa89e0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T11:09:20.846Z","isSynthetic":true}
